license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-12"
abstract: "A deterministic, model-free soft-block / silent-scrape oracle — the MCP-native trust-gate between a scraper's Unblocker and its AI Parser. Scores a single HTTP response against six deterministic features and a JSON signature file, returning one of five verdicts (REAL, SOFT_BLOCK, CHALLENGE, DECOY_EMPTY, LAYOUT_DRIFT) with a full explainable feature trace. No model in the decision path."
keywords:
  - mcp
  - web-scraping
  - anti-bot
  - soft-block
  - silent-failure
  - deterministic
  - trust-gate
